  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "I have an unusual job.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "VuZANu6p9t",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "I teach robots how to dance.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "KtchDP90RQ",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "In 2017, I transitioned from dancing on stages with humans to dancing with robots.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D_jBd828Hk",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "Big robots, small robots, single-arms and roving robots.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "H5lVmvca41",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "Robots that fly, vacuuming robots.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "XS7iVVvdu7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "A lot of robots that look like humans.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "YBMoeFjOeT",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "And a whole bunch that don't.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "bh3Nj074z0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "I'm pretty sure I've choreographed and danced with more different types of robots than anyone on Earth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "w_dJPVvmv-",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "Why do I do this?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E3An4EUMhw",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Because robots move and choreographers understand how movement affects us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "tXezxf1ryv",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 3,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "a robot slides politely out of a doorwa",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "QAyY2WJmNn",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 61,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "might make you feel seen and acknowledged.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "O_mOUt9h0g",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "If a robot marches quickly towards you and avoids you at the last second",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4YPVQzr8NP",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "If a robot marches quickly towards you and avoids you at the last second, it might cause revulsion and fear.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6X5e0NespF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 67,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "sidewalks to offices, backyards to hospitals",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1vGh8nlitm",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "And they will be threatening and confusing to us if we do not carefully examine how they move.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9xb-9li9Vk",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "I'm also a roboticist and an engineer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "OYYOsFfzlu",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "I study this connection between robot motion and emotion.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "rvvaFt6TKT",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "I combine my expertise in robotics and dance in the emerging field of choreo-robotics, the intersection of dance and robotics.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2UovS72DKP",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "Right now, we're giving AI a robot body with physical intelligence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "cNUoNlymNQ",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 86,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "robots are getting smarter",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "_lfDKZNrWy",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "Much smarter.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "RRTEzNPDlu",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "Think of what AI has already done to text and video generation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4N6C0f9gw7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 12,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "scratching the surface",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "olYWa2GM1f",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "intelligent robots",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "RVfkakNXYN",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 145,
        "text": "Roboticists already spend a lot of time thinking about movement, but they think about it in terms of efficiency, optimizing for speed or success.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8cIGALmj-0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "That's not enough.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "-WgAuHfeNd",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "We need to teach robots how to dance.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "UNCERTAIN"
        ]
      },
      "id": "k1bUpL082n",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 183,
        "text": "If a robot can dance, make every movement with intention, agility, balance, emotional expression and grace, I believe they will also become better caregivers, teachers and companions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1hehwmwjMI",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "It will help us build better general-purpose robots that we actually want to live amongst us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "uIZ6xTOUdS",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "expand the future of intelligent machines",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ZRq3sy1fX2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 79,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "these highly scripted performances have captured the public's imagination",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "e4VWZ84PpS",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 135,
        "text": "They've made us feel wonder, made us laugh, made us want to dance along, and sometimes made us never want to meet a robot in real life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "UTGzh_HL-u",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "Dancing with robots is no longer just about art or entertainment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3ivem_xrEa",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 135,
        "endOffset": 189,
        "text": "applying those lessons to robots in our everyday lives",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2EWbm2EZoh",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "Robotics engineers are beginning to consider emotion and context when designing intelligent machines that interact with us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "SBpswttXIS",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "The choices we make now are going to dictate how we live our lives with robots.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6ab95VsC4d",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 22,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "robots will be more welcomed, safe, and delightful",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "dIfmzTtCC0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "Humans will be more empowered and comfortable.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Tsmwe2WNHx",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "Before AI, programmers needed hours to script a simple dance sequence for robot to perform.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "rwJAmezri1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "Just like they needed hours to script the robot to open a single door.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3Yo9e-QqSk",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "With AI, you can teach the robot to open just a few specific doors, and it will learn to open all of them, even ones it hasn't seen before.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "hx6dT_C-Ow",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "It's also true for dance.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "v3BIF-rJ1o",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 163,
        "text": "You can teach the robot to dance with a specific person, and it will learn how to dance and move with many others in many different environments and circumstances.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "g3Y1FcWHCb",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "This is what I did at Everyday Robots, then a robot AI moonshot at Google.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "lb-hX60Kpj",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "teach 15 robots how to move together as a flock",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0j0YFZuEtn",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 179,
        "text": "We imagined a world where you could walk down a hallway filled with robots, and they would part to make space for you, like a flock of doves or a crowd of people on a city street.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "aBLOuWE-4p",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "Where a robot could navigate seamlessly and even beautifully through a busy, chaotic Times Square.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "XaGJa4yrCK",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "The world we live in is complicated for robots to understand",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "bLpOeH48_7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "teach the robots how to improvise and react.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "eFhhg-Cd5e",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "This was a massive challenge that had never been done before, and the result is an interactive performance and installation work called Project Starling.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "gv8Bdy7Hs8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "This took us two years of hardcore engineering to complete.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "fGqpQem4CH",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "We trained an AI agent on the preferences of a choreographer, me.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "QcelbDyt6q",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "I chose the most engaging patterns and sequences.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "UNCERTAIN"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Q5Hhx8vpIo",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "We also taught the robots how to recognize and respond to human gestures.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "UNCERTAIN"
        ]
      },
      "id": "r1VIxweMf0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "we turned the robots into musical instruments.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "dO7UogyxHR",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "Each joint on the robot was mapped to a different sound.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "k1LcreGR5a",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "When the robot's torso moved, triggered a bass sound.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ct9lFCgpgT",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "Its hand opening and closing triggered a bell sound.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "e09rB5TqbL",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "The robot's actions created its own unique symphony.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Z5dupf2ylf",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "This is what Project Starling looks like.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2CE_cABudE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "Our AI generated movement and our robot generated music.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "gLt0M6eYwF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 164,
        "text": "I wanted it to feel like stepping out of your normal reality and into a waking dream, one that was so far from where we stand today.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "mwLGhmZ3GN",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "Yet, all the same felt like a world where your kids could grow up and feel calm, where you could be surrounded by machines and it felt natural and safe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "UNCERTAIN"
        ]
      },
      "id": "vx-rywbl6d",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 174,
        "text": "People were drawn to just wander amongst these robots, you know, some were a bit tentative at first, but then they began to engage and explore with curiosity and playfulness.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "YjnHzkEjjX",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "People kept coming back.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8VQD7QzoML",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "What we learned about gesture, navigation, human interaction and expression can be applied to robots more generally.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "pyldZkJQ7f",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Think of the following future scenario.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "KIrp59R8m7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "A robot in a senior living facility, waiting in a crowded cafe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Tel579KtHL",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "the robot understands that you would like a glass of water.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DDW9pV7Y5Q",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 134,
        "text": "And when it drives over to you with its glass of water, it nods at the other people it passes and pauses graciously to let them go by.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "KuNPUaOjqx",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "And when it arrives at your table, it places the glass gracefully down.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "tNvBgSgyNS",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "And when you thank it, it nods in acknowledgment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7GTqRyN23I",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "Maybe it even performs a small celebratory dance in place.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "NHoBL-HzOJ",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "We can choose to build and program robots that we welcome.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "sF7aI0eqE4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Robots that make us feel understood.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0_VrnQub_J",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Robots that make us feel understood.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3WmShtjvy7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Robots that we want to spend time with.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Dk6IyDWXu7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Robots that we want to spend time with.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1LHW0-r_eZ",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 15,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "robots that will live and work amongst us",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "aTiV0GJkya",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Yes, we can have robots that do our chores.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "rM0rn0rNfW",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 204,
        "text": "From Karel Capek's 1920 play \"Rossum's Universal Robots\" to The Jetsons' Rosey the Robot to C-3PO of \"Star Wars\" and even Terminator, these stories have been deeply impactful in what we imagine and build.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "VtxvPcRzrE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "But we can also have robots be our dance partners.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "UNCERTAIN"
        ]
      },
      "id": "gat-zywS51",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "ceramics to diplomacy, singing in choirs to vertical farming.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "uEWzKNWov3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "Imagine a world where robots can do a myriad of things that are functional or creative, and everything in between.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "XGn9V5yfMv",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 146,
        "text": "General-purpose robots are coming, and they will help us to address big demographic challenges like aging populations and massive labor shortages.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "weM1j0G2vp",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "And how they move will unlock whether we let them into our homes and welcome them in our workplaces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "GswFr0LHF7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Because we want to feel like we're still marvelously human in this increasingly AI world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BDZUpcqQ8-",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "And we can, because we have the power to choreograph the future we want.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "c1qg8UaKBq",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Bomj7A-7hM",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "zrxnMNNaCO",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}